msgstr "Zinn® ሆስቲንግ ለWordPress"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-promo.php:425
msgid "LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site."
msgstr "LiteSpeed፣ ዕለታዊ ምትኬዎች፣ ነጻ ፍልሰት እና ከአንድ በላይ ድረ-ገጾችን ለሚያስተዳድሩ ሰዎች የተሰራ የቁጥጥር ፓነል።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-promo.php:431
msgid "The Zinn® marketplace"
msgstr "የ Zinn® የገበያ ቦታ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-promo.php:432
msgid "Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy."
msgstr "ሁለቱም ወገኖች እስኪረኩ ድረስ ገንዘቡ በደህንነት ተይዞ የተቋቋሙ ድረ-ገጾችን፣ ዶሜይኖችን እና የአገናኝ ምደባዎችን ይግዙ እና ይሽጡ።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-promo.php:479
msgid "Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living"
msgstr "Zinn Hub® — ይህን በሙያቸው የሚያደርጉ ሰዎችን ይቅጠሩ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-promo.php:480
msgid "Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid."
msgstr "ዓለም አቀፍ የፍሪላንስ የገበያ ቦታችን፡ ከጸሐፊዎች፣ ዲዛይነሮች፣ ገንቢዎች እና የSEO ባለሙያዎች የቀረቡ ከ10,000 በላይ ዝግጁ አገልግሎቶችን ያስሱ፣ ወይም ፕሮጀክት ለጥፈው ጨረታ እንዲያቀርቡ ያድርጉ።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:73
msgid "Media Offload"
msgstr "የሚዲያ ማስተላለፊያ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:79
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:94
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "ግንኙነት"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:83
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:118
msgid "What gets moved"
msgstr "የሚዘዋወረው ነገር"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:87
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:175
msgid "How media is served"
msgstr "ሚዲያ እንዴት እንደሚቀርብ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:101
msgid "Move a batch now"
msgstr "አንድ ስብስብ አሁን ያንቀሳቅሱ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:119
msgid "Media already moved is never affected by a change here — its address does not change."
msgstr "ቀደም ሲል የተዛወረ ሚዲያ እዚህ በሚደረግ ለውጥ በጭራሽ አይነካም — አድራሻው አይቀየርም።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:124
msgid "New uploads"
msgstr "አዲስ የተሰቀሉ ፋይሎች"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:125
msgid "Move new uploads to Zinn® storage as they arrive"
msgstr "አዳዲስ የተሰቀሉ ፋይሎች እንደደረሱ ወደ Zinn® ማከማቻ ያንቀሳቅሱ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:131
msgid "Existing media"
msgstr "ነባር ሚዲያ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:132
msgid "Keep moving the media library that is already here"
msgstr "እዚህ ያለውን የሚዲያ ቤተ-መጽሐፍት ማንቀሳቀስዎን ይቀጥሉ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:133
msgid "A few files an hour, in the background, picking up where it left off. Turning this off pauses it; nothing already moved comes back."
msgstr "በየሰዓቱ ጥቂት ፋይሎች ከበስተጀርባ ሆነው ከቆሙበት ይቀጥላሉ። ይህንን ማጥፋት ለአፍታ ያቆመዋል፤ አስቀድሞ የተወሰደ ምንም ነገር አይመለስም።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:139
msgid "Files per hourly pass"
msgstr "ፋይሎች በየሰዓቱ ማለፊያ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:140
msgid "Each attachment is several files and every one is a full upload. Raise this on a fast host with a generous execution limit; lower it if passes are being cut short."
msgstr "እያንዳንዱ አባሪ በርካታ ፋይሎች ያሉት ሲሆን እያንዳንዳቸውም ሙሉ ጭነት ናቸው። ፈጣን አስተናጋጅ እና ሰፊ የማስፈጸሚያ ገደብ ባለው ላይ ይህንን ያሳድጉት፤ ዙሮች እየተቋረጡ ከሆነ ይቀንሱት።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:149
msgid "Leave files smaller than"
msgstr "ከዚህ ያነሱ ፋይሎችን ይተው፦"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:150
msgid "Kilobytes. A tiny icon costs more in the extra connection than it saves in disk, so there is rarely a reason to move one. Set to 0 to move everything."
msgstr "ኪሎባይቶች። ጥቃቅን አዶ በዲስክ ከሚቆጥበው ይልቅ ተጨማሪ ግንኙነት በማስከተል የበለጠ ወጪ ያስወጣል፣ ስለዚህ አንዱን ለማንቀሳቀስ የሚያበቃ ምክንያት እምብዛም የለም። ሁሉንም ለማንቀሳቀስ ወደ 0 ያቀናብሩ።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:158
msgid "Never move these types"
msgstr "እነዚህን አይነቶች በፍጹም አያንቀሳቅሱ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:159
msgid "Useful when a plugin reads a file straight off the disk — a font, a PDF a form builder stamps, an audio file a player seeks inside."
msgstr "ተሰኪ ፋይልን በቀጥታ ከዲስክ ሲያነብ ጠቃሚ ነው — ፊደል ቅርጽ፣ ቅጽ ሰሪ የሚያትመው ፒዲኤፍ፣ ማጫወቻ በውስጡ የሚያስስበት የድምጽ ፋይል።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:176
msgid "These two are the ones to be careful with — read each description before changing it."
msgstr "ጥንቃቄ ሊደረግባቸው የሚገቡት እነዚህ ሁለቱ ናቸው — ከመቀየርዎ በፊት እያንዳንዱን መግለጫ ያንብቡ።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:181
msgid "Serve from Zinn® storage"
msgstr "ከZinn® ማከማቻ አቅርብ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:182
msgid "Point image and file addresses at Zinn® storage"
msgstr "የምስል እና የፋይል አድራሻዎችን ወደ Zinn® ማከማቻ ያመልክቱ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:183
msgid "Off, files are uploaded but still served from this server — which is the safe state while you check everything arrived. On, visitors are served from storage and this server stops carrying the traffic."
msgstr "ሲጠፋ ፋይሎች ይሰቀላሉ ነገር ግን አሁንም ከዚህ አገልጋይ ይቀርባሉ — ይህም ሁሉም ነገር መድረሱን በሚያረጋግጡበት ጊዜ ደህንነቱ የተጠበቀ ሁኔታ ነው። ሲበራ ጎብኚዎች ከማከማቻው ይስተናገዳሉ እና ይህ አገልጋይ ትራፊኩን ማስተናገድ ያቆማል።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:189
msgid "Free the disk space"
msgstr "የዲስክ ቦታውን ነፃ ያድርጉ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:190
msgid "Delete the local copy once every size has uploaded"
msgstr "እያንዳንዱ መጠን ከተጫነ በኋላ አካባቢያዊ ቅጂውን ሰርዝ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:191
msgid "This is the point of offloading, and it is also the irreversible half. Leave it off until “Serve from Zinn® storage” is on and you have checked your site — a local copy is the only thing that saves you if something was missed."
msgstr "የማውረድ ዋናው ዓላማ ይህ ነው፣ እንዲሁም የማይቀለበሰው ግማሽ ክፍል ይህ ነው። «ከZinn® ማከማቻ አቅርብ» እስኪበራ እና እርስዎ ጣቢያዎን እስኪፈትሹ ድረስ እንዳጠፉት ይተዉት — የሆነ ነገር ቢያመልጥ እርስዎን የሚያድንዎት ብቸኛው ነገር አካባቢያዊ ቅጂ ነው።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:198
msgid "Deleting local copies cannot be undone from this screen. Take a backup first — the Zinn® Connector plugin can do that for you."
msgstr "የአካባቢ ቅጂዎችን መሰረዝ ከዚህ ማያ ገጽ መመለስ አይቻልም። መጀመሪያ ምትኬ ይውሰዱ — የ Zinn® Connector ተሰኪ ይህንን ለእርስዎ ሊያደርግልዎ ይችላል።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:233
msgid "This site is not connected to Zinn® storage yet, so there is nowhere to move media to."
msgstr "ይህ ጣቢያ እስካሁን ከZinn® ማከማቻ ጋር አልተገናኘም፣ ስለዚህ ሚዲያን የሚያዘዋውሩበት ቦታ የለም።"

#. translators: %d: how many attachments were moved.
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:241
#, php-format
msgid "%d attachment moved."
msgid_plural "%d attachments moved."
msgstr[0] "%d አባሪ ተወስዷል።"
msgstr[1] "%d አባሪዎች ተወስደዋል።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:258
msgid "This site is not connected to Zinn® storage."
msgstr "ይህ ጣቢያ ከZinn® ማከማቻ ጋር አልተገናኘም።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:259
msgid "Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Media stays on this server until it is."
msgstr "ምንም የተበላሸ ነገር የለም — እስካሁን አልተጣመረም ብቻ። እስኪጣመር ድረስ ሚዲያ በዚህ አገልጋይ ላይ ይቆያል።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:269
msgid "Connected, but the last upload failed."
msgstr "ተገናኝቷል፣ ነገር ግን የመጨረሻው ጭነት አልተሳካም።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:272
msgid "Try a batch now"
msgstr "አንድ ስብስብ አሁን ይሞክሩ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:283
msgid "Connected. Every attachment has been moved."
msgstr "ተገናኝቷል። እያንዳንዱ አባሪ ተወስዷል።"

#. translators: 1: attachments still local, 2: total attachments.
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:286
#, php-format
msgid "Connected. %1$s of %2$s attachments still on this server."
msgstr "ተገናኝቷል። ከ%2$s አባሪዎች %1$s አሁንም በዚህ አገልጋይ ላይ ይገኛሉ።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:310
msgid "Moved so far"
msgstr "እስካሁን የተወሰደው"

#. translators: 1: number of files, 2: human-readable size.
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:313
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s files, %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s ፋይሎች፣ %2$s"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:319
msgid "Still on this server"
msgstr "አሁንም በዚህ አገልጋይ ላይ ያለ"

#. translators: 1: attachments not yet offloaded, 2: total attachments.
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:322
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s of %2$s attachments"
msgstr "ከ%2$s አባሪዎች ውስጥ %1$s"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:328
msgid "Served from"
msgstr "የቀረበው ከ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:331
msgid "this server"
msgstr "ይህ አገልጋይ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:352
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:377
msgid "Connect this site"
msgstr "ይህን ጣቢያ ያገናኙ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:354
msgid "Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, choose this site, open Files & databases, and press “Get a pairing code” under Images & video CDN. Paste the code below."
msgstr "የ Zinn Digital® የመቆጣጠሪያ ሰሌዳዎን ይክፈቱ፣ ይህንን ጣቢያ ይምረጡ፣ «ፋይሎች እና የውሂብ ጎታዎች»ን ይክፈቱ፣ እና «ምስሎች እና ቪዲዮ CDN» ስር «የማጣመሪያ ኮድ ያግኙ» የሚለውን ይጫኑ። ኮዱን ከታች ይለጥፉት።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:362
msgid "Pairing code"
msgstr "የማጣመሪያ ኮድ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:380
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:387
msgid "Disconnect this site"
msgstr "ይህን ጣቢያ ያላቅቁ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:382
msgid "New uploads will stay on this server. Media already moved keeps working — its address does not change."
msgstr "አዳዲስ ሰቀላዎች በዚህ አገልጋይ ላይ ይቆያሉ። ከዚህ ቀደም የተዛወሩ ማህደረ መረጃዎች መስራታቸውን ይቀጥላሉ — አድራሻቸው አይለወጥም።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:400
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:433
msgid "You do not have permission to manage this site."
msgstr "ይህን ጣቢያ የማስተዳደር ፈቃድ የለዎትም።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:408
msgid "Paste the pairing code from your Zinn Digital® dashboard."
msgstr "የማጣመሪያ ኮዱን ከእርስዎ Zinn Digital® የመቆጣጠሪያ ሰሌዳ ላይ ይለጥፉ።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:417
msgid "Connected. New uploads will be stored with Zinn Digital® from now on, and your existing media will move in the background."
msgstr "ተገናኝቷል። አዳዲስ ሰቀላዎች ከእንግዲህ በZinn Digital® ይቀመጣሉ፣ እና አሁን ያሉት የሚዲያ ፋይሎችዎ በጀርባ ይዛወራሉ።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-settings.php:445
msgid "Disconnected. Media already moved keeps working; new uploads stay on this server."
msgstr "ተለያይቷል። ቀደም ሲል የተዛወሩ ሚዲያዎች መስራታቸውን ይቀጥላሉ፤ አዳዲስ ሰቀላዎች በዚህ አገልጋይ ላይ ይቆያሉ።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-streaming-upload.php:87
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-streaming-upload.php:145
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-streaming-upload.php:264
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-streaming-upload.php:272
msgid "That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded."
msgstr "ያ ፋይል ከዚህ አገልጋይ ሊነበብ አልቻለም፣ ስለዚህ ምንም አልተሰቀለም።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-streaming-upload.php:226
msgid "This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent."
msgstr "ይህ ጣቢያ ጭነቱን ማስተላለፍ አልቻለም፣ ስለዚህ ምንም አልተላከም።"

#. translators: 1: file size, 2: the largest size this site can send.
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-streaming-upload.php:249
#, php-format
msgid "This file is %1$s and this site's PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s."
msgstr "ይህ ፋይል %1$s ነው፣ እንዲሁም የዚህ ጣቢያ PHP cURL የለውም፣ ስለዚህ ሊሰቅለው የሚችለው ትልቁ መጠን %2$s ነው።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-streaming-upload.php:331
msgid "The upload could not be completed."
msgstr "ጭነቱን ማጠናቀቅ አልተቻለም።"

#. translators: %d: HTTP status code returned by the storage service.
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-streaming-upload.php:341
#, php-format
msgid "Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d)."
msgstr "ማከማቻው ጭነቱን አልተቀበለውም (HTTP %d)።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-style-presets.php:118
msgid "Style preset"
msgstr "የቅጥ ቅድመ-ቅምጥ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-style-presets.php:119
msgid "A starting point. Anything below overrides it."
msgstr "መነሻ ነጥብ። ከዚህ በታች ያለው ማንኛውም ነገር ይተካዋል።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-style-presets.php:126
msgid "Use my own colours and sizes"
msgstr "የራስዎን ቀለሞች እና መጠኖች ይጠቀሙ"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-style-presets.php:127
msgid "Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is."
msgstr "ይህን ሳያበሩት ከተዉት ቅድመ-ቅምጡ ባለበት ሁኔታ ጥቅም ላይ ይውላል።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-updater.php:253
msgid "See the Zinn Digital® release notes."
msgstr "የ Zinn Digital® የተለቀቁ ማስታወሻዎችን ይመልከቱ።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-updater.php:302
msgid "The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again."
msgstr "የ Zinn® ማዘመኛ አገልግሎት ለዚህ ዝማኔ የማውረጃ አገናኝ አልሰጠም። ይህ ጣቢያ የ Zinn® መድረክን ማግኘት መቻሉን ያረጋግጡ፣ ከዚያ እንደገና ይሞክሩ።"

#. translators: %s: the download error reported by WordPress.
#: includes/class-zinn-offload-updater.php:316
#, php-format
msgid "The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "ዝማኔውን ከZinn® የማዘመኛ አገልግሎት (%s) ማውረድ አልተቻለም። እባክዎ ከጥቂት ደቂቃዎች በኋላ እንደገና ይሞክሩ።"

#: includes/class-zinn-offload-updater.php:330
msgid "The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed."
msgstr "የወረደው ዝማኔ የታማኝነት ፍተሻውን አላለፈም እና አልተጫነም።"
